WEBVTT

00:08.808 --> 00:16.850
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.850 --> 00:24.848
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.365 --> 00:36.169
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.169 --> 00:39.172
Believing, dreaming

00:39.172 --> 00:43.009
We are searching

00:43.009 --> 00:48.140
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.949 --> 00:58.358
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.358 --> 01:02.929
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.929 --> 01:05.598
Ah, surely someday

01:05.598 --> 01:13.873
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.873 --> 01:18.833
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.380 --> 01:27.013
Let's begin our journey

01:36.563 --> 01:38.224
Now you should understand.

01:38.965 --> 01:40.990
The god Thor isn't even worth mentioning.

01:41.568 --> 01:45.299
Aside from me, there's no one
who will kill Loki.

01:45.805 --> 01:48.103
I, Heimdall, am the only one.

01:50.577 --> 01:56.277
The 3rd Night
The Assassin Descends!

01:56.549 --> 01:59.017
That sounds like a mystery!

01:59.385 --> 02:03.056
The birds at the zoo have started
attacking people all of a sudden!

02:03.056 --> 02:05.524
This is truly a strange mystery!

02:05.859 --> 02:09.129
I'm their caretaker,

02:09.129 --> 02:12.530
but now they attack me even
when I go to feed them.

02:14.167 --> 02:16.795
And this is why you've called upon
this detective agency?

02:17.103 --> 02:20.607
Yes. The veterinarian says there's
nothing wrong with the birds.

02:20.607 --> 02:23.906
And the police aren't willing to help out
with an animal problem.

02:27.080 --> 02:28.515
What should we do?

02:28.515 --> 02:30.183
Well...

02:30.183 --> 02:33.753
I don't really like over-the-top
cases like this.

02:33.753 --> 02:34.187
Maybe I should have her go...

02:34.187 --> 02:35.121
Just leave it to me!
Maybe I should have her go...

02:35.121 --> 02:35.644
Just leave it to me!

02:36.189 --> 02:38.191
This mysterious incident is a case for

02:38.191 --> 02:41.027
the Enjaku Detective Agency's
beautiful girl detective...

02:41.027 --> 02:44.861
Mayura Daidoji! I'll get to the bottom of this!

02:47.600 --> 02:50.569
My name is Tsubasa Maijima.
I appreciate your help.

02:51.104 --> 02:54.073
It seems they've reached an agreement.

02:54.407 --> 02:57.143
Mayura, I'm the one who's in charge here.

02:57.143 --> 02:58.578
All right, then let's meet here on Sunday at 9:00.
You can't just go and...

02:58.578 --> 02:59.977
All right, then let's meet here on Sunday at 9:00.

03:01.147 --> 03:02.478
Did you catch all that, Loki?

03:05.952 --> 03:08.750
Hurry, or the mystery will get away!

03:10.957 --> 03:12.559
Listen, Mayura.

03:12.559 --> 03:15.328
I keep telling you, this whole
"mystery" thing is...

03:15.328 --> 03:16.818
Make a right there!

03:19.599 --> 03:21.000
They're running pretty late...

03:21.000 --> 03:23.836
I'm sorry to have you come out
here on your day off.

03:23.836 --> 03:25.205
No, it's nothing!

03:25.205 --> 03:29.335
In our line of work, days off don't
really figure into things.

03:32.845 --> 03:34.813
Sorry! Forgive me!

03:35.415 --> 03:37.750
Do you have any idea how long
you kept us waiting?

03:37.750 --> 03:40.344
Don't be mad! I'll buy you some
ice cream to make it up to you.

03:40.720 --> 03:42.188
Listen, Mayura.

03:42.188 --> 03:44.986
That's not the point I'm trying to make.

03:45.858 --> 03:47.093
So you're the one, eh?

03:47.093 --> 03:49.362
You're the guy who's giving Mayura
all these strange notions

03:49.362 --> 03:51.664
about evil spirits and mysteries!

03:51.664 --> 03:52.765
Who is this?

03:52.765 --> 03:53.766
My dad!

03:53.766 --> 03:56.402
Mayura! You need to stop hanging
around with people like this

03:56.402 --> 03:58.838
just because you think these kinds
of things are interesting.

03:58.838 --> 04:02.242
I keep telling you, there's no such thing
as ghouls or grim reapers.

04:02.242 --> 04:03.676
That's right.

04:03.676 --> 04:05.974
I agree with you completely.

04:22.228 --> 04:23.855
What's wrong, Dad?

04:25.164 --> 04:26.532
Um...

04:26.532 --> 04:29.000
Oh, the restroom? It's this way.

04:30.670 --> 04:34.507
Unlike Mayura, it seems you
are able to see them.

04:34.507 --> 04:36.441
Don't be ridiculous!

04:36.609 --> 04:39.669
It's a trick! Yes, it's just some kind of trick!

04:42.015 --> 04:45.815
In that case, why don't I show you
something more interesting?

04:47.887 --> 04:50.617
It's pretty fierce, so be careful
not to get killed, okay?

04:50.823 --> 04:52.450
What did you say?

04:55.395 --> 05:00.133
O, mythical beast Audhumla, who
wanders the void of Ginnungagap!

05:00.133 --> 05:01.623
Awaken from your slumber,

05:02.402 --> 05:04.097
and come now before me!

05:19.018 --> 05:21.111
What the heck is that?

05:22.155 --> 05:24.953
It looks more like a familiar
than a mythical beast.

05:26.059 --> 05:28.721
Perhaps you botched the summoning?

05:32.165 --> 05:34.292
It said "punyan."

05:35.068 --> 05:36.235
Sorry to keep you waiting!

05:36.235 --> 05:38.465
We'll be going then.
See you, Mayura's dad.

05:39.772 --> 05:40.773
Mayura!

05:40.773 --> 05:42.365
See ya later!

05:42.909 --> 05:45.036
She doesn't see it?

05:45.345 --> 05:48.439
Okay! It's a mystery!

05:53.086 --> 05:55.054
It's the zoo!

05:55.455 --> 05:57.056
Wait, Mayura!

05:57.056 --> 05:58.523
It's so cute!

05:59.225 --> 06:00.692
It's so big!

06:01.394 --> 06:03.191
It's so cool!

06:03.596 --> 06:05.331
C'mere, c'mere! Check out this small one!

06:05.331 --> 06:06.265
C'mere, c'mere! Check out this small one!
I wonder if we'll actually make it
to our destination by nightfall.

06:06.265 --> 06:06.699
I wonder if we'll actually make it
to our destination by nightfall.

06:06.699 --> 06:08.701
But what is it?
I wonder if we'll actually make it
to our destination by nightfall.

06:08.701 --> 06:09.502
It says this is the mysterious, blood-sucking...

06:09.502 --> 06:11.704
It says this is the mysterious, blood-sucking...
Well, you could certainly say
she has a lot of energy.

06:11.704 --> 06:11.904
It says this is the mysterious, blood-sucking...
An endless supply, even...

06:11.904 --> 06:13.573
An endless supply, even...

06:13.573 --> 06:13.940
We've gotten stuck with a real weirdo.

06:13.940 --> 06:15.771
Let's go look at that!
We've gotten stuck with a real weirdo.

06:16.409 --> 06:16.909
That's awesome!

06:16.909 --> 06:18.044
That's awesome!
You think so?

06:18.044 --> 06:19.045
Whoa, cool! It says this animal...

06:19.045 --> 06:21.047
Whoa, cool! It says this animal...
Well, I don't tire of her.

06:21.047 --> 06:21.536
Whoa, cool! It says this animal...

06:27.286 --> 06:28.688
Hey, Loki!

06:28.688 --> 06:31.090
They say the baboon couple's gotten
into a lover's quarrel!

06:31.090 --> 06:32.489
C'mon, hurry!

06:43.603 --> 06:45.238
It's you!

06:45.238 --> 06:47.206
Oh, Narugami...

06:47.407 --> 06:48.533
I...

06:48.775 --> 06:50.743
I...

06:51.377 --> 06:53.345
What's with you?

06:54.380 --> 06:55.847
I've...

06:56.749 --> 06:59.775
Always wanted to try something like this on!

07:00.887 --> 07:02.514
Hey...

07:04.424 --> 07:04.924
Lu-ta-tah, Lu-ta-tah!

07:04.924 --> 07:06.359
Lu-ta-tah, Lu-ta-tah!
Loki! What are you even doing
in a place like this?

07:06.359 --> 07:08.294
I'm an ant-eater, I'm an ant-eater!
Loki! What are you even doing
in a place like this?

07:08.294 --> 07:08.694
Lu-ta-tah, this is great!

07:08.694 --> 07:10.363
Lu-ta-tah, this is great!
Nothing really. A picnic, maybe.

07:10.363 --> 07:11.364
Nothing really. A picnic, maybe.

07:11.364 --> 07:13.059
Break Room

07:15.935 --> 07:17.402
You didn't mention anything...

07:20.506 --> 07:21.803
about me, did you?

07:22.575 --> 07:23.542
Heimdall...

07:23.776 --> 07:27.613
I mean, you're his ally, right?

07:27.613 --> 07:28.815
No!

07:28.815 --> 07:31.284
I don't consider myself his ally.

07:31.284 --> 07:32.452
It's just...

07:32.452 --> 07:35.751
I haven't found a reason to kill him yet.

07:36.823 --> 07:39.192
It's the same thing either way.

07:39.192 --> 07:40.989
You and I are not the same.

07:41.727 --> 07:46.032
I swear both by Odin and my
own thirst for revenge,

07:46.032 --> 07:47.800
that I will kill Loki.

07:47.800 --> 07:49.791
Heimdall. You're...

07:51.070 --> 07:52.367
See you later.

08:00.947 --> 08:02.348
Here, huh?

08:02.348 --> 08:03.474
Yes.

08:04.183 --> 08:05.650
No Entry
Authorized Personnel Only

08:09.655 --> 08:10.622
Go ahead.

08:27.874 --> 08:29.609
It's pretty quiet.

08:29.609 --> 08:30.735
Yeah.

08:31.978 --> 08:36.278
There are a lot of people here today,
so the birds are probably on their guard.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.051
What do you think?

08:39.051 --> 08:41.621
There's not really anything unusual here.

08:41.621 --> 08:42.849
Well, then...

08:43.523 --> 08:48.294
Maybe there was something that excited them.

08:48.294 --> 08:51.197
A light earthquake, or the scent of
a natural enemy, or something.

08:51.197 --> 08:52.965
No, that's not it.

08:52.965 --> 08:56.093
The birds are angry.

09:00.940 --> 09:03.238
I'm sorry. I just...

09:03.910 --> 09:09.041
Well, sometimes as I'm taking care
of them it just seems that way.

09:09.615 --> 09:13.019
I really love them.
That's why I became a bird handler.

09:13.019 --> 09:19.151
But maybe all I'm doing is keeping them
locked up and making them suffer.

09:22.228 --> 09:23.855
That can't be!

09:24.030 --> 09:27.199
They must despise me.

09:27.199 --> 09:28.666
Tsubasa!

09:29.302 --> 09:31.804
Birds don't even have the
mental capacity for hatred.

09:31.804 --> 09:33.271
You've just got the wrong idea.

09:39.345 --> 09:42.314
Loki, consider this my greeting.

09:55.261 --> 09:56.228
A hawk?

10:29.895 --> 10:30.691
Mayura!

10:32.598 --> 10:34.233
What was I...

10:34.233 --> 10:35.700
Are you okay?

10:45.211 --> 10:46.212
Loki...

10:46.212 --> 10:49.215
Now I'll make sure you taste to the fullest...

10:49.215 --> 10:51.513
the agony that my punishment has brought me.

10:52.218 --> 10:55.415
And I'll do it in the way that
will hurt you the most.

10:57.189 --> 11:00.852
Bamboo shoots really are best
straight from the farm.

11:01.227 --> 11:05.061
See how this bamboo shoot sashimi
has such tenderness...

11:05.931 --> 11:07.899
To say nothing of its scent and sweetness.

11:09.001 --> 11:11.637
I didn't feel any evil back there.

11:11.637 --> 11:12.763
But still...

11:15.341 --> 11:18.970
She said there was no wild hawk
that had been let into the cage.

11:20.246 --> 11:23.044
And even if there had been,
that was no normal hawk.

11:24.450 --> 11:25.417
A hawk?

11:27.186 --> 11:28.653
It couldn't be...

11:55.715 --> 11:57.512
What are you doing here in the
middle of the night?

11:58.584 --> 12:01.485
There is something I have to
talk to you about.

12:09.929 --> 12:12.557
Wait here a second.
My room's kind of a mess.

12:21.974 --> 12:24.101
What is this?

12:37.056 --> 12:37.954
Mayura!

12:38.257 --> 12:39.189
Mayura!

12:53.806 --> 12:55.273
Mayura...

13:20.199 --> 13:23.999
It seems that this has calmed
the birds' anger somewhat.

13:24.470 --> 13:26.305
Yes...

13:26.305 --> 13:29.708
I wonder if they'll all forgive me.

13:29.708 --> 13:32.006
Don't be ridiculous! Not yet.

13:33.412 --> 13:36.415
Your sins run incredibly deep.

13:36.415 --> 13:38.645
You won't be able to atone
for them so easily.

13:39.585 --> 13:41.052
You are right.

13:41.787 --> 13:43.556
Then get going!

13:43.556 --> 13:44.853
Next will be Loki's...

13:46.659 --> 13:47.819
Loki!

13:50.196 --> 13:52.824
Seeing that hawk and the girl
made me remember.

13:53.365 --> 13:55.701
I recall a certain Scandinavian god,

13:55.701 --> 13:58.329
Heimdall, who was particularly good
at controlling people's minds.

14:00.606 --> 14:02.107
Why have you come here?

14:02.107 --> 14:03.909
It's obvious.

14:03.909 --> 14:06.579
I have come here at Odin's command.

14:06.579 --> 14:08.069
To exterminate you!

14:10.549 --> 14:13.552
Evil god you may be, but you
can't hide your agitation.

14:13.552 --> 14:16.350
Still, this isn't the only thing
that brought me here.

14:16.922 --> 14:21.594
He's trying to catch the birds and
lock them all away in some dark place.

14:21.594 --> 14:22.661
No!

14:22.661 --> 14:25.687
Beat him. I'll grant you the power.

14:37.776 --> 14:39.044
Heimdall...

14:39.044 --> 14:41.012
You've filled her with evil, haven't you?

14:42.081 --> 14:44.948
Stop it! The birds aren't angry
or anything like that!

14:45.618 --> 14:49.247
This is all just an illusion created
by the darkness in your heart!

14:50.222 --> 14:51.189
Speak no more!

15:11.777 --> 15:15.736
The evil power is responding to the darkness
in her heart, and growing larger and larger!

15:16.815 --> 15:17.839
I have no choice!

15:44.143 --> 15:45.110
Wait!

15:50.282 --> 15:54.241
If you want to save her,
then stay right where you are.

15:55.487 --> 15:57.045
Mayura doesn't have anything to do with this!

15:57.356 --> 16:00.484
Then why is she always with you?

16:00.693 --> 16:02.820
She just follows me around
of her own accord!

16:04.763 --> 16:06.865
Is that really all?

16:06.865 --> 16:08.230
Let's make sure.

16:29.555 --> 16:33.685
It's no good. As long as I'm stuck in
this body, I can't hold her up!

16:39.732 --> 16:41.700
So that's how it is, huh?

16:43.736 --> 16:45.137
What now?

16:45.137 --> 16:47.339
Remain like that and lose your grip?

16:47.339 --> 16:49.341
Or will you fall with her into the water...

16:49.341 --> 16:52.511
that which you hate more
than anything else?

16:52.511 --> 16:53.912
Or...

16:53.912 --> 16:58.349
Will you return my right eye and
save both of your lives?

16:58.684 --> 17:01.353
This is the other thing that
brought you here?

17:01.353 --> 17:02.287
Yeah.

17:02.287 --> 17:06.087
Unfortunately, I don't have it.

17:06.325 --> 17:07.860
In that case...

17:07.860 --> 17:08.758
Die!

17:30.582 --> 17:31.549
What the?

17:39.725 --> 17:41.192
Mayura!

17:45.664 --> 17:46.961
Why?

17:50.402 --> 17:52.204
I see...

17:52.204 --> 17:55.173
I never thought that you would
be able to help me.

17:57.409 --> 18:00.579
Return the girl...

18:00.579 --> 18:03.707
or they won't forgive me.

18:31.543 --> 18:34.413
Hey! Where the hell is Mayura?!

18:34.413 --> 18:37.616
I'm telling you she's not here!

18:37.616 --> 18:39.151
A deception!

18:39.151 --> 18:42.678
You've used your tricks to
kidnap my daughter!

18:45.257 --> 18:47.555
I... I won't stand for this!

18:47.659 --> 18:50.729
What do you think you're doing?
Nothing! Nothing at all!

18:50.729 --> 18:53.298
I'm going to sneak back to my house now.

18:53.298 --> 18:57.136
Just pretend you don't know what
happened, and send my father home.

18:57.136 --> 19:00.128
Yeah, I think I've had enough
violence for one night.

19:00.606 --> 19:05.244
I just can't believe I sleepwalked
to the zoo of all places.

19:05.244 --> 19:08.447
That's my line. It really was
a lot of trouble, you know.

19:08.447 --> 19:11.483
I remember Tsubasa coming over, but I
completely forget everything after that.

19:11.483 --> 19:14.620
It's like a mystery.

19:14.620 --> 19:17.289
Oh, it's a mystery!

19:17.289 --> 19:19.691
Like, the spirits of the animals
called out to me in my dreams!

19:19.691 --> 19:22.660
Or maybe it was the curse of the
zoo of man-eating animals!

19:24.830 --> 19:26.525
It's cold.

19:31.436 --> 19:32.304
What?

19:32.304 --> 19:35.273
Wear it home.
It's better than nothing, right?

19:39.978 --> 19:42.776
Your jacket's too small for me.

19:48.520 --> 19:51.148
Wow, it's warmer than I expected!

19:51.523 --> 19:53.320
Thanks! See ya!

20:02.167 --> 20:04.135
Well, if it isn't Loki!

20:05.571 --> 20:08.907
So this is the neighborhood you live in.

20:08.907 --> 20:10.676
Is he your friend, Loki?

20:10.676 --> 20:12.177
You're so cute!

20:12.177 --> 20:14.446
I'm Mayura Daidoji.

20:14.446 --> 20:15.845
Nice to meet you...

20:20.385 --> 20:23.522
I'm Loki's friend, Kasumi Higashiyama.

20:23.522 --> 20:24.853
Nice to meet you.

20:28.160 --> 20:30.395
Huh? Oh, I see.

20:30.395 --> 20:33.632
You guys don't kiss casually
around here, do you?

20:33.632 --> 20:37.159
I'm sorry. I've just returned
from abroad, you see.

20:38.070 --> 20:41.198
She sure is cute, Loki.

20:42.441 --> 20:43.738
You...

20:44.509 --> 20:48.570
But everyone has their weaknesses
and these can be exploited.

20:51.583 --> 20:53.676
Well, I'll be seeing you, Mayura.

20:54.987 --> 20:56.420
Uh... sure!

21:25.217 --> 21:26.707
Tell me just one thing.

21:28.253 --> 21:31.923
It's a serious crime for one god
to take another god's life.

21:31.923 --> 21:34.926
But even so, you'll still do it?

21:34.926 --> 21:39.488
I'll kill Loki regardless of what
kind of sin it may be.

21:41.199 --> 21:44.191
I swear it by my right eye.

21:57.316 --> 22:00.615
Just you wait, Loki.

22:17.102 --> 22:29.071
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.782 --> 22:42.527
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.527 --> 22:49.735
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.735 --> 22:56.074
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:56.074 --> 23:05.584
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.584 --> 23:09.921
Even if we're hurt

23:09.921 --> 23:21.933
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.933 --> 23:23.662
Believe in Heaven

23:31.443 --> 23:33.078
Next Episode

23:33.078 --> 23:35.547
Next Episode
The next episode's keywords are,
"brawl," "memory," and "Cat Detective."

23:35.547 --> 23:36.715
Next Episode
Oh, that brings back memories!

23:36.715 --> 23:39.584
Next Episode
To save the Earth from crisis, it's the Catnip
Planet's great hero of justice, Cat Detective!

23:39.584 --> 23:41.253
Next Episode
cat Detective
To save the Earth from crisis, it's the Catnip
Planet's great hero of justice, Cat Detective!

23:41.253 --> 23:41.586
Next Episode
cat Detective
Now we've gotten completely off-track.

23:41.586 --> 23:42.754
Next Episode
Now we've gotten completely off-track.

23:42.754 --> 23:43.655
Next Episode
We have?

23:43.655 --> 23:46.158
Next Episode
Oh, that Cat Detective. You sure used to
love that story when you were little.

23:46.158 --> 23:50.429
Next Episode
I remember! When I was little I used
to love salting my natto, right?

23:50.429 --> 23:52.097
Next Episode
And I even used to put
soy sauce on sponge cake!

23:52.097 --> 23:52.931
Next Episode
All right, already!

23:52.931 --> 23:54.933
Next Episode
And condensed milk in my tea!

23:54.933 --> 23:55.867
Next Episode
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.867 --> 23:56.401
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.401 --> 23:56.835
The 4th Night
My Dad's a Great Detective?!
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.835 --> 23:58.103
The 4th Night
My Dad's a Great Detective?!
"My Dad's a Great Detective?!"

23:58.103 --> 24:00.205
The 4th Night
My Dad's a Great Detective?!
Sounds like another strange mystery!

